
Authentication required for the CVE provider: 'conancenter'

To resolve, please:
  1. Visit: https://conan.io/audit/register
  2. Register to obtain the access token and activate it.
  3. Use the command below to authenticate:

     conan audit provider auth conancenter --token=<your_token>

Once authenticated, re-run the command.

